{"In fetch_error_details, zip(error_ids, events.values()) assumes the dict returned by nodestore.backend.get_multi() preserves the same iteration order as the input node_ids list, but this is not guaranteed - the Django backend returns results in arbitrary DB order and omits missing entries, and get_multi merges cache hits via items.update(cache_items), causing error IDs to be paired with wrong event data": 0.966238260269165, "In BrowserReportSerializer.validate_timestamp and validate_age, the check uses Python truthiness (self.initial_data.get('age') and self.initial_data.get('timestamp')), so age=0 or timestamp=0 (valid values) are treated as absent, breaking the mutual exclusion invariant when both fields are zero - should use 'age' in self.initial_data instead": 0.9596520066261292}